█	v1.0.1 - MAJOR UPDATE:
█	
█   ✨ NEW FEATURES
█   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
█   🎮 Dual Stick Parity - Left stick now matches Right stick capabilities
█      • All 18 aim assist shapes available on both sticks
█      • Unified activation logic (Normal mode: Fire only or ADS+Fire)
█      • Consistent behavior across both sticks
█      • ADS mode: Separate settings when "Outside Focus" enabled
█
█   🔧 Enhanced Activation Modes
█      • Normal Mode: Uses base settings (LeftSpeed/Size, RightSpeed/Size)
█      • ADS Mode: Uses ADS-specific settings when "Outside Focus" ON
█      • Proper gating: aim assist only activates when speed/size > 0
█      • Clear function naming: isLeftNormalAimAssistActivated(), isLeftAdsAimAssistActivated()
█
█   📝 CODE QUALITY IMPROVEMENTS
█   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
█   ✅ Enum mapping comments added to all settings for better maintainability
█   ✅ Clear documentation of activation logic in function comments
█   ✅ Consistent naming convention (Normal vs ADS, not "Legacy")
█   ✅ Removed unused AdsShapes constant array
█
█   🐛 FIXES & IMPROVEMENTS
█   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
█   ✅ Fixed Orbit and Rose shapes array indexing
█   ✅ Fixed Left-Right shape restoration
█   ✅ Fixed ADS+Fire activation with OutsideFocus ON
█   ✅ Fixed Left stick aim assist shape selection
█   ✅ Removed local variable declarations (strict GPC compliance)
█   ✅ Improved SPVAR bit-packing for memory efficiency
█   ✅ Enhanced weapon detection accuracy
█   ✅ Cleaned up dead code and unused constants
█
